5,1,1,talk,Mio,,I'm worried about where the money actually goes before we even start.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Victoria,,We need to know who is actually standing in the room next season.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Shion,,The paper trail is usually where the real story hides.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Asuka,,The floor has limits. I need to know what breaks first.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Shizue,,"I just want to see where we stumbled last time, honestly.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Mio,,"@Victoria, are you thinking about the people or the numbers?","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Victoria,,"Both, but the people determine if the numbers make sense.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Shion,,"@Mio, costs are easy to hide. Attendance is harder to fake.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Shion, paperwork doesn't stop a crate from cracking the tile.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Shizue,,"@Asuka, I hear you. But the cracks usually start with the delivery.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Mio,,I want to see the transport costs and the mount-making charges.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Victoria,,I will look into the volunteer roster and the conservation lab staffing.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Shion,,I am checking the visitor comment slips and the weekend head counts.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Asuka,,I need the structural survey and the maintenance log for powered displays.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Shizue,,I will look into the lender paperwork and the evening hire bookings.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Mio,,"Okay, let's see what the numbers say before we promise anything.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Victoria,,I hope the roster tells the truth about who is left.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Shion,,"The comments will tell us what they actually felt, not what we thought.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Asuka,,"If the bay fails, the whole plan fails. I need that data.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Shizue,,Let's hope the paperwork matches the reality this time.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
