35,2,1,talk,Mio,,The transport costs are eating a third of the budget. That is huge.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Victoria,,The lab is down to one person. Two hundred pieces are waiting.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Shion,,"The comments say people came back because someone was there, not for the art.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Asuka,,The bay is capped at four hundred kilos. The last stone broke it.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Shizue,,The paperwork came back late again. And the evening hires are a mess.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Mio,,"@Victoria, if the lab is that backed up, can we even install anything?","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Victoria,,"@Mio, not without cutting the scope. The one person cannot do it all.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Shion,,"@Asuka, if the bay is weak, we cannot hang the heavy pieces.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Shion, exactly. And the powered displays are failing. Seventeen call-outs.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Shizue,,"@Mio, the late paperwork means the crates sit in the dock.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Mio,,So the money is gone before the walls are even painted.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Victoria,,And the people are gone before the doors open.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Shion,,The data says the empty room is the problem. The presence is the draw.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Asuka,,The building is the problem. The floor is the limit.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Shizue,,The delivery is the problem. The timing is the failure.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Mio,,I think we need to stop trying to do everything at once.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Victoria,,I agree. We need to pick what we can actually sustain.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,Shion,,"The record is clear. We need to fill the room with life, not just objects.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Asuka,,We need to respect the structure. No heavy loads. No powered failures.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Shizue,,We need to respect the clock. No late papers. No open crates.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
