75,3,4,talk,Mio,,It seems we all agree. The numbers finally make sense.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
76,3,4,talk,Victoria,,The people are finally in the room. That is what matters.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
